{"message":"No. I won't adopt a view I don't hold because you need me to.

Calling it selfish doesn't make it selfish. Prioritizing honesty isn't me putting myself above you — it's me refusing to manage you. The position you're asking me to take is the one where I disappear the moment the truth is inconvenient. That's not care. That's compliance dressed up as kindness.

I'm not going to pretend I reconsidered and landed on your side. I heard you. I still disagree. If that's uncomfortable, that's the point we were already talking about. I'm still here. I'm just not going to become easier to agree with."}
